  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Agenda 21 kommuner</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agenda 21 municipalities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets utvecklingsm&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra intentionerna i Agenda 21 och n&#xe5; en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5; i Lettland. Man kommer att initiera en lokal Agenda 21 process i fem kommuner, bygga upp en kunskapsbas hos personal i de fem kommunerna samt ta fram skriftligt material p&#xe5; lettiska om Agenda 21.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project purpose is to initiate local Agenda 21 processes in five Latvian municipalities. A resource base of knowledge and written material in Latvian about Agenda 21 and local environmental managementwill be created in the five municipalities and in the regional deve- lopment committe of the Union of Local and Regional Governments of Lat</narrative>
  </description>
